eff-large-wordlist.txt

The word list in this folder is the EFF Large Wordlist for Passphrases, by the
Electronic Frontier Foundation, published at
https://www.eff.org/deeplinks/2016/07/new-wordlists-random-passphrases
and licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 United States licence
(CC BY 3.0 US): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/

Changes from the original: the dice numbers before each word were removed, and
the four words containing a hyphen (drop-down, felt-tip, t-shirt, yo-yo) were
left out, because Lintel joins the words of a passphrase with hyphens.
That leaves 7,772 words.
